    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Floor summary: DEBATE - The House proceeded with 10 minutes of debate on the motion to recommit with instructions.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H36100",
   "actionDate": "2002-09-26",
   "actionTime": "14:39:24",
   "committees": [
    {
